# This project needs no API keys or secrets to run.
#
# The demo, training, evaluation and tests only read local files:
#   - NASA C-MAPSS FD001 files in data/raw/
#   - processed artifacts in data/processed/
#   - checkpoints in checkpoints/ and experiments/runs/
#
# If you later add a hosted component (e.g. a model registry), put its
# credentials here and copy this file to .env (which is git-ignored).
#
# Example of the shape a future secret would take:
# MODEL_REGISTRY_TOKEN=
